[Music]  hi  i'm isaac in this video i'm going to  give you an overview of apogee's api  monitoring capabilities  apis are the foundation of modern  connected applications  from mobile banking to self-driving cars  from retail to healthcare  nearly every digital interaction today  is underpinned by apis  therefore api service degradations can  directly impact your customers  experience  your reputation and even your revenue  to ensure seamless connected experiences  for developers customers and partners  operations teams today want to assure  api service quality  proactively identify api issues before  customers do  quickly diagnose those issues and take  appropriate remedial actions  fast all of these capabilities are  available through the apigee edge  platform to empower your operations  teams  and increase api reliability let me show  you  apigee api monitoring can alert you to  live issues via slack  pagerduty or in this case email  clicking through you can see the alert  details including a link to a playbook  that recommends remedial action for this  particular type of issue your playbook  could be a wiki  page a diagnostics manual a triage  flowchart  or other relevant documentation of your  choice let's go a little deeper here  clicking through you are now taken to a  rich contextual view of the error and  the circumstances surrounding it  in the first section you can find the  basic condition details  and again a link to the playbook  scrolling down  you can see these powerful co-occurrence  matrices two-dimensional views that  allow you to quickly visualize and  pinpoint the nature and source of the  error  operations teams can often spend hours  navigating multiple systems to gather  and cross-correlate this information  but apogee api monitoring can provide it  for you in just a few clicks  you can also click the report icon on  the right to generate a custom report  you'll see it's already pre-populated  with just the right set of filters  specific to 